What this package contains

  * 93 capability contracts under src/registry/, derived from the author's solution
  requirements document. That document is NOT published with this package; what ships
  is its normalized projection at src/registry/source.json, which carries the
  document's SHA-256 so a holder of the original can confirm the projection matches.
  * 16 skills under skills/, and the governance policies under src/policies/.
  * A deterministic governance server under servers/enterprise_core/.

The capability contracts and requirement statements are the author's own design
work, written to be vendor-neutral and industry-neutral. No employer-confidential
material, customer data, proprietary threshold or internal system reference is
included.

Standards and frameworks referenced by name in the source document (NIST AI RMF,
NIST AI 600-1, ISO/IEC 42001, OWASP GenAI Security Project) are cited for
alignment only. This package is not certified against them and makes no
conformance claim.

Third-party Python dependencies (mcp, pyyaml) are resolved at runtime by uv and
are licensed by their respective authors; none are vendored here.
